&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5"&gt;（当事業年度において株式数が増加した銘柄）&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:35pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:390pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:105pt;min-width:105pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:60pt;min-width:60pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:112.5pt;min-width:112.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:112.5pt;min-width:112.5pt;"/&gt;
